+# QXFRAME9A7C2 fix(11) FINAL Hotfix 2
+
+日期：2026-09-21
+基线：`QXFRAME9A7C2-v2.19.81-fix11-FINAL-2026-09-21`
+状态：已通过 Node release gate + 强制 Chromium browser gate。
+
+## 1. 本轮用户反馈与结果
+
+| 问题 | 状态 | 收口方式 |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| InputOTP `separator` Runtime Schema 报错 | 已修复 | `separator: string/function`、`placeholder: string/array`；补 Runtime contract + browser regression |
+| Select 单选键盘 Enter 后不关闭 | 已修复 | Field 自己处理 Enter commit；Trigger `keyboardActivation:false`，避免 commit 后再次 toggle |
+| Cascader 键盘 Enter 无法正确赋值 | 已修复 | 键盘 cursor/path 与 commit 统一；Enter 叶节点 commit + 单选关闭 |
+| TreeSelect Enter 不能赋值且 active 跳项 | 已修复 | TreeSelect 键盘 commit 只消费当前 activeKey；Trigger 不再二次处理 Enter |
+| DatePicker Enter 选择后不关闭 | 已修复 | 普通单选 Enter commit 后关闭 |
+| DatePicker needConfirm Enter 关闭但未选择 | 已修复 | Enter 只更新 draft，保持 popup 打开，等待 Confirm |
+| DatePicker 年/月标题键盘不可操作 | 已修复 | title 成为正式 tab stop；方向键切换年/月；Enter 进入 year/month drill panel |
+| DatePicker 年/月 drill focus handoff | 已修复 | 使用 `Core.DOM.focusElement` 回到 field host，避免 native `.focus()` 平行路径 |
+| Menu 上下键不能跨层级 | 已修复 | inline 展开树使用 visible-node 线性导航；↑/↓ 跨层，←/→ disclosure-only，与 Tree contract 对齐 |
+| Transfer 双 outline | 已修复 | ItemCollection virtual-focus host 不再绘制主 outline，只保留 active descendant ring |
+| List 双 outline | 已修复 | 同上 |
+| OptionList 双 outline | 已修复 | 同上 |
+| Tree 双 outline | 已修复 | 同上 |
+| TimePanel wrapper / scroll viewport 多 outline | 已修复 | wrapper / viewport 明确 `outline:none`，焦点视觉由实际 active item owner 表达 |
+| Tags wrapper + tagShell 双 outline | 已修复 | Tags wrapper `outline:none`，active tag shell 为唯一视觉焦点 |
+| JSON 双 outline | 已修复 | virtual-focus owner root 不绘制 ring，仅 active JSON action/item 绘制 |
+| PeriodPanel 与 Calendar 键盘/焦点/高亮不统一 | 已修复 | PeriodPanel 补齐 Calendar 同款 VirtualFocus binding；二者 cell 状态合并为 `.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-cell` canonical CSS |
+
+## 2. PeriodPanel / Calendar 最终统一
+
+两者现在共同使用：
+
+```text
+.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel
+.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-header
+.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-title
+.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-title-action
+.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-nav
+.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-cell
+```
+
+`date-panel-cell` 统一拥有：
+
+```text
+hover
+active
+keyboard-focus
+current / today
+in-range
+range-start / range-end
+selected
+selected + hover/active
+disabled
+```
+
+Calendar/PeriodPanel 只保留自己的布局/单位/分页行为，不再各自维护第二套状态视觉。
+
+## 3. 新增防回退
+
+- Runtime Schema source/demo drift 继续为 0。
+- `Menu.loop` 正式进入 Runtime Schema。
+- verify 强制 `ItemCollection` virtual-focus host suppress root outline。
+- verify 强制 PeriodPanel 必须 `bindVirtualFocus(keyboard.virtualFocus, false)`。
+- verify 强制 Calendar/PeriodPanel keyboard-focus 与 selected interaction 由 `.qxframe9a7c2-date-panel-cell` 统一拥有。
+- verify 禁止重新出现 Calendar/PeriodPanel 各自 `.is-keyboard-focus` CSS 分叉。
+
+## 4. 最新验证
+
+### Node / Release Gate
+
+`npm test`：PASS
+
+```text
+72 modules
+40 visible components
+13 Core / 21 Headless / 30 DOMHeadless
+Runtime Schema sourceContractDrift = 0
+Runtime Schema demoContractDrift = 0
+CSS specificity warnings = 0
+CSS long-selector warnings = 0
+CSS large-selector-group warnings = 0
+src/dist exact rebuild = PASS
+11-stage CSS aggregate = PASS
+```
+
+### Chromium Browser Gate
+
+`QX_BROWSER_REQUIRED=1 npm run verify:browser`：PASS
+
+本轮新增真实 browser assertions 全部通过：
+
+```text
+InputOTP separator / placeholder polymorphism
+Select Enter commit + close
+Cascader Enter commit + close
+TreeSelect Enter commit + close
+DatePicker normal Enter commit + close
+DatePicker needConfirm draft + keep-open
+DatePicker year/month title arrows + drill panel + focus handoff
+Menu nested visible-node navigation
+List single focus owner
+OptionList single focus owner
+Tree single focus owner
+Transfer source/target single focus owner
+TimePanel no wrapper/viewport outline
+Tags wrapper outline zero
+JSON single focus owner
+PeriodPanel keyboard focus projection
+PeriodPanel / Calendar shared date-panel family
+```
+
+原有复杂组合矩阵和 Diagnostics resource balance 同样继续 PASS。
+
+## 5. 当前结论
+
+这轮不是新增第三套 focus/keyboard 系统，而是把遗漏 consumer 继续迁回已有 canonical owner：
+
+```text
+KeyboardRegion
+VirtualFocus
+TriggerInteraction
+Core.DOM.focusElement
+shared date-panel CSS family
+```
+
+已知本轮用户反馈项：**全部已进入自动 browser regression 并通过。**
